  "description": "After a KERI 2.0 inception, an attachments group holds a generic list (-J) of one 5-byte value with code 5B (Bytes, lead size 1): 5 bytes need one lead byte to fill whole triplets, and the code's two size characters count the 2 triplets of lead bytes and value together. The parser must take the value's length from the size characters and strip the lead bytes.",
